# Databricks Apps (pip) preinstalls outdated dash/gradio/streamlit that conflict
# with our pinned stack (flask 3.1+, pillow 12, protobuf 6, etc.). Ontos does
# not use these frameworks; listing newer versions overrides the preinstalls so
# pip's dependency resolver stops failing the Apps build with conflict errors.
# See: https://docs.databricks.com/aws/en/dev-tools/databricks-apps/dependencies
